  "summary": "The City of Cambridge announced it is terminating its contract with Flock Safety after deactivating and removing 16 ALPR cameras in late October 2025, then discovering Flock technicians installed two additional cameras in November without the City's awareness. The City called this a material breach of trust and plans to conduct a thorough evaluation of ALPRs going forward.",
  "key_quotes": [
    {
      "quote": "In late October 2025, 16 Flock ALPRs that were deployed in the community were deactivated and removed by the City.",
      "paragraph_idx": 3
    },
    {
      "quote": "concerns about Flock were substantiated when they notified the City that two cameras were installed by their technicians in late November -- without the City's awareness",
      "paragraph_idx": 3
    },
    {
      "quote": "Due to this material breach of our trust and the agreement, the City is terminating its contract with Flock Safety.",
      "paragraph_idx": 3
    }
  ],
